{
  "description": "Shared test vectors for the §1 path rule: [input, expected]. r1.js, ingest, the WordPress plugin, the PHP helper and the Search Console import must all pass these. If any percent-escape is malformed (not %XX) or the decoded bytes are not valid UTF-8, the path stays undecoded. All trailing slashes are removed except for '/'.",
